    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d66">

                <pb facs="0064" n="54" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg54"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/1–1549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-01-17T19:00:00-05:00">January 17, 1949—7
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Re Tientsin’s 68 Jan 15 rptd Nanking concerning possible bombing Tientsin,
                    Emb authorized its discretion make approach similar that authorized Deptel 1519
                    Nov. 1.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d66-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
